[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
Shinya "Good evening, Yume. I came to visit again."[p]
#由芽
Yume "........."[p]

(What's wrong? She's been off since before.)[p]

Her room seemed much more cluttered than before too.[p]
Inside, Yume sat -- lifeless.[p]

Shinya "Yume, are you okay? Was the sex we had last night too much?"[p]
#由芽
Yume "...Mm."[p]
Shinya "You look pretty down on TV lately. Even on social media, people were worried."[p]
Shinya "You looked so drained. That you had none of your usual energy... Though some people actually liked that listless ennui of yours."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Oh, I see..."[p]
Shinya "Finally, some real words outta you. A proper adult's gotta be able to answer you know?"[p]
#由芽
Yume "Yeah... Sorry..."[p]
Shinya "Yume, what were you up to?"[p]
#由芽
Yume "N-Nothing..."[p]
Shinya "You weren't doing anything? So you've just been spacing out since you got back yesterday?"[p]

#由芽
Yume "Mm..."[p]
Shinya "It's your day off though, what a waste! Or what, were you so lonely that I couldn't come because I was busy with building inspections?"[p]
Shinya "Sorry about that. But I'll be with you all day tomorrow so I hope you're excited."[p]
#由芽
Yume "........."[p]

Without even looking up, she responded with just a faint nod.[p]

(Well this is a problem. It's great that she's obedient... but she's just been moping around all the time.)[p]
(Maybe I should bring her out next time. Scandals or whatnot be damned.)[p]
(Worse comes to worst, she can just announce a marriage and that'll be the end of that.)[p]

Shinya "Hm? Yume, what is this?"[p]

A single book on the table caught my eye.[p]
On the cover read "Celebrities Galore! Meeting with the superstar specialist! (temp)".[p]

#由芽
Yume "That's... a script..."[p]
Shinya "A script? So this is for that upcoming special?! Are you gonna be on it too?"[p]
#由芽
Yume "........."[p]
Shinya "I don't like it when you keep secrets from me... Well, I'll find out in a snap once I check the script."[p]

I opened the cover to see that Yume's name was listed as the MC's assistant.[p]

(And the MC is a super popular comedian.)[p]
(I'd expected no less from Yume, to have bagged an appearance in such a big program.)[p]

Shinya "Oh, and they're even filming with a live audience. That's crazy..."[p]
Shinya "But you haven't looked through the script at all. Are you okay?"[p]
#由芽
Yume "Okay..."[p]

(Given how earnest she is, she probably already has the general flow of the program down pat.)[p]

Shinya "Good luck Yume. I'm excited to watch the show too."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Okay..."[p]
Shinya "I'm so proud to have a popular news anchor as my girlfriend."[p]

(There's countless guys out there jacking off, imagining a naked Yume.)[p]
(But I'm the real winner here...! Because Yume is all mine!)[p]
(She only listens to what I say and follows my every whim... The perfect girlfriend.)[p]

Shinya "Oh, right. So when I had a remote-controlled vibrator inside you during that recording--"[p]

[_tb_end_text]

