[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
Shinya "Eh...?"[p]

I staggered from a sudden impact from behind me.[p]
I turned my head around to see Yume, who clung to me as she leaned her body against mine.[p]

Shinya "Yume, what's gotten--"[p]

(Eh? What the... My back feels so hot...!)[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[bg  time="5000"  method="fadeInUp"  storage="event_ED_1_1.jpg"  ]
[tb_cg  id="cg5"  ]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#由芽
Yume "Just release me... I hate it... I can't take it anymore... I'm going to break..."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Rei, Mom, Dad, I'm sorry... Forgive me..."[p]
Shinya "W-What are you...?"[p]

Intense pain and a burning heat spread throughout my body.[p]
In a panic, I checked my waist, only to find it hot and wet.[p]
I looked at my palm to see--[p]

(B-Blood...!)[p]

#由芽
Yume "This is all your fault..."[p]

I thrust Yume away and even more pain raced through my back and spine.[p]

Shinya "Huh...? What's going on?"[p]

I turned around to see Yume standing, knife in hand.[p]

#由芽
Yume "Once you're gone, I'll be free..."[p]
#由芽
Yume "I can go back... to how things used to be..."[p]
Shinya "Yume...? Why did you do this...?"[p]

(Even though I simply loved you--)[p]
#由芽
Yume "Why did I...?"[p]
#由芽
Yume "Because I hate you, so very much..."[p]
Shinya "Huh...? What are you saying?"[p]

(Where did I go wrong...? What should I have done?)[p]
(No, I was wrong... about everything...)[p]

Shinya "Yume, I'm sorry..."[p]

My strength left me as I collapsed to the floor.[p]
The smell of iron clung to my nose.[p]

#由芽
Yume "It's too late to say sorry... Way too late..."[p]
#由芽
Yume "Urk, waahhhhh! Sniff, hic... Aaaghhh!"[p]
Shinya "Please, don't cry..."[p]

As the coldness and pain assailed my senses, I closed my eyes.[p]
Eventually, I could no longer hear her cries beside me.[p]
[_tb_end_text]

